message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Kinzan market quake archive"
abstract: "Every day a tracked currency, coin, stock, index, commodity or bond yield moved three or more standard deviations of its own previous 20 daily returns, measured close to close on settled days."
